        "text_AejeA6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Cover Express specializes in crafting weather covers tailored specifically for scooters and power wheelchairs. Founded by Bill Shehwen over nineteen years ago, the company recognized the demand for this niche product early on.<br/><br/>“When I started this business,” Shehwen explains, “we were in the medical mobility and equipment industry, but I wasn’t satisfied with the available covers. So, we decided to create our own high-quality ones.”<br/><br/>However, Cover Express initially faced challenges in finding a reliable label manufacturer for their new venture. They needed custom labels that could be delivered promptly without compromising quality or breaking the bank..</p>",
