    "custom_content_w9mYa3": {
      "type": "custom-content",
      "blocks": {
        "text_NWGJqA": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "content_alignment": "left",
            "subheading": "",
            "heading": "Solution",
            "highlight_style": "none",
            "highlight_font_style": "italic",
            "highlight_style_color": "",
            "highlight_text_color": "",
            "heading_size": "h2",
            "description": "<p>In search of a solution to its labeling dilemma, Cover Express found an ideal partner in NADCO Tapes & Labels. With its home base in Sarasota, Florida, and its reputation for providing innovative solutions and efficient processes, it seemed the perfect partner.<br/><br/>First things first, NADCO assigned them a dedicated account manager to ensure seamless communication and a consistent understanding of their needs.<br/><br/>The assurance of great customer service provided by this dedicated account manager was a huge relief. However, the question remained: could NADCO offer their services at a competitive price?<br/><br/>To address this, NADCO proposed a tailored approach called the “stock holding program.”<br/><br/>This program allows companies like Cover Express to streamline their supply chain and access products promptly when needed.<br/><br/></p><h2><br/><br/></h2>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--primary",
            "button_icon": "none",
            "width": "50%",
            "alignment": "center",
