    "rich_text_JqHApq": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_prxxq7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>It’s designed to save money through bulk purchasing, improved inventory management, and optimized production schedules.<br/><br/>“We set ourselves apart by offering this service,” Neil Doniger, Co-owner of NADCO, explained. “It’s the best way to handle inventory for our clients, so when they need it urgently, we’ve got them covered. It’s about building relationships, not just making sales.”</p><p>Partnering with NADCO as their label provider, Cover Express benefits from swift label production, enabling them to meet tight deadlines and customer demands seamlessly.<br/><br/>Additionally, with a dedicated account manager prioritizing their business needs, there’s a meticulously maintained order history, ensuring each processing step is efficient and accurate.<br/><br/>Leveraging NADCO’s expertise and unwavering support, Cover Express can focus on delivering top-notch products while upholding efficiency and cost-effectiveness in its day-to-day operations.<br/><br/>Today, Cover Express continues to rely on NADCO for agile labeling solutions. Whether it’s adapting to new cover sizes, styles, or colors or promptly addressing customer requests through its stock holding program, the future of its robust partnership remains bright.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
            "button_icon": "none"
          }
        }
